/'*
 * Set the text prepended to log messages of a given priority.
 *
 * By default SDL_LOG_PRIORITY_INFO and below have no prefix, and
 * SDL_LOG_PRIORITY_WARN and higher have a prefix showing their priority, e.g.
 * "WARNING: ".
